SUMMARY:⚽ 🇳🇱 Netherlands v 🇩🇪 Germany (A2)
DESCRIPTION:🇳🇱 Netherlands v 🇩🇪 Germany\nMatchday 1 - Group A
 2 (League A)\nThursday 24 September 2026\n\nKick-off\n20:45 CET  |  18:4
 5 UTC\n\nNotes\n2026/27 UEFA Nations League\, fifth edition. 54 teams ac
 ross Leagues A-D. League A\, B and C sides play six matches\; League D p
 lay four.\n\nNew this year: an extended September-October window\, with 
 four matchdays played in close succession from 24 Sep to 6 Oct.\n\nLeagu
 e A quarter-finals and the A/B and B/C play-offs run 25-30 March 2027. T
 he four-team Finals are 9-13 June 2027\; host and exact dates still to b
 e confirmed. Portugal are defending champions.\n\nThe competition also f
 eeds into EURO 2028 qualifying\, with some teams getting a second route 
 through the play-offs.
CATEGORIES:Nations League,League A,Matchday 1
